", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822034_1163443652496605_4437736750532399358_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DKYvLMvu9qQQ7kNvwHWGl96&_nc_oc=AdpEntEJSBA6QJPjI2ZRwjvNOhNP5H2BwjbLYRGAYLRwCwetlD1CEmS85HmSAM6zsxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF_w-819c4Ki7pIJt7ZHx_dehTp8VPTV3vpDoXje2VYnA&oe=6A85A503"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "724629803656108", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303198_724629806989441_9037091471697535725_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gtfiyL4hqXgQ7kNvwFb0PnC&_nc_oc=Adp5UUGP6A-oiWIeAt9k84W2nAv0Wf6X_QmSLMMI8p6YIIJG86muL73Nq6rt05NArh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGNa0WBHRVDkzqUPv3RnGClfrt2h7MNIwFh6UbnSFFX3Q&oe=6A8593CE"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "555738367475449", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303672_555738370808782_4745762157325174194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GQIEjyMsFi0Q7kNvwHCxXug&_nc_oc=Adp_kVq8JMJAEJ93skCBuat7pJhg79XhfNo9rJ5by4gPgmrcCTKdDqsLk2dIj0QsONs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGMFLXGkmhNtCy6ntP4OJGymSvl61z5LJ_0OQnwry36qg&oe=6A85936B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AphX", "keywords": ["chimp", "monke", "physics", "sandbox", "physix"], "long_description": "Inspired by Chemp Physics by XORWIRE Games, and Bonelab by Stress Level Zero, Aphx is a physics based gorilla-tag style movement game which you can build stuff, or just mess around. \n\nUse the AphX Tablet to control the entire game!\nJust from the AphX Tablet alone, you can:\n- Select items to spawn\n- Adjust color\n- Adjust cosmetics\n- Adjust movement style\n- Get help\n- Go through a tutorial\n\nAnd more to come!\n\nThank you XORWIRE Games for making this possible.", "short_description": "Inspired by Chemp Physics by XORWIRE Games, and Bonelab by Stress Level Z